# Per-machine and per-person files. Anything named `*.local.*` or `*.local` stays out of
# git: `.conductor/settings.local.toml`, `.claude/settings.local.json`, `CLAUDE.local.md`,
# `compose.local.yaml`, `.env.local`, and the like. Their shared counterparts are committed.
*.local.*
*.local

# Conductor. `.context` is the workspace's scratch space shared between agents. The shared
# `.conductor/settings.toml` is committed.
.context/

# Claude Code's runtime state. The shared `.claude/settings.json`, `.claude/skills/`, and
# `CLAUDE.md` are committed.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/checkpoints/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.*

# Secrets and overrides for running the image locally, e.g. with Docker Compose.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
compose.override.yaml
docker-compose.override.yml

# OS and editor files.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
